fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecparsers/gstmpegvideoparser.html#GST_MPEG_VIDEO_PACKET_IS_SLICE","fragment":"\n\tGST_MPEG_VIDEO_PACKET_IS_SLICE\n\nChecks whether a packet type code is a slice.\nParameters:\nThe MPEG video packet type code\nTRUE if the packet type code corresponds to a slice,\nelse FALSE.\n"});